 "library": {
  "title": "King in armour 1.9 m",
  "description": "A crowned king in plate armour with a cape. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1900 mm tall (619 x 639 x 1900 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 9 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/king/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 11100 triangles.",
